<title>GERMANY: Bayerische Landesbank says 1996 profit unchanged.</title>
<headline>Bayerische Landesbank says 1996 profit unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				    441    vs 441</p>
<p>    Group oper profit after provisions    710    up 53</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the unlisted, publicly-owned German regional bank is Bayerische Landesbank (BayernLB). The bank said it hoped to post a similarly high profit for 1997.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
